{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are three (not necessarily different) numbers chosen randomly and with replacement from the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d36426dfd8e1a5a953ced8ca573b10c0f2327c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,4,5 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" />, the probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea0ab3e1013ea39ee7ec0b685bd44457d857529.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> is even is\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/9415f9709e6d4498b7d40fe08ccf395498cb50c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ \\frac {2}{5} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ \\frac {59}{125} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ \\frac {1}{2} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ \\frac {64}{125} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ \\frac {3}{5} }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"397\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The probability of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> being odd is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/2/a1280951d2f9c11c0f0b023466b14b598cdc5c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac 35\\right)^2 = \\frac{9}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"95\" height=\"48\" />, so the probability of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> being even is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/0/ad0ab90fbaecbf9d1d5a3ef1155a573beade41b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\frac{9}{25} = \\frac {16}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The probability of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> being odd is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daadf8d12321aa8913af98e9ccb98f4ddfd9616c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3/5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> and being even is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f568e6598e1bdb1664691a4dcbb263ad2b0e9d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/67624b0072ad825c27e9e7352f68819b64e93f4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> is even if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are both odd, with probability <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/786df7d03f7b1a63a0a3171386c362a2cd533575.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{25} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5} = \\frac{27}{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />; or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are both even, with probability <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e606927e5e136f9992617fa5e0ef943814b8cf34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16}{25} \\cdot \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{32}{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />. Thus the total probability is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/2/0c2ce1bdd01fe31021958a5bff476add1b2357b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{59}{125} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 A